#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_ems_em_grading_wizard__line_ids
msgid "Module grades"
msgstr "Notas por módulo"

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model,name:ems.model_ems_em_grading_wizard_student
msgid "Work placement (EM) grading wizard: one student of the group."
msgstr "Asistente de nota de EM: un estudiante del grupo."

#. module: ems
#: code:addons/ems/models/grades/em_grading_wizard.py:0
msgid "Enter the work placement grade of at least one student."
msgstr "Introduce la nota de las prácticas de al menos un estudiante."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_ems_em_grading_wizard_line__subject_acronym
msgid "Subject code"
msgstr "Código de la asignatura"

#. module: ems
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ems.view_em_grading_wizard_form
msgid ""
"Pick the group and grade the students who have finished their work\n"
"                            placement: the EM grade of a student goes to every module of theirs\n"
"                            carrying a placement weight — the modules of the course in progress and\n"
"                            the finals of previous courses still pending. Tick \"Grade per module\"\n"
"                            only for the exceptions: it turns on one cell per module, so that\n"
"                            student can get a different grade in each. Empty cells are never\n"
"                            written. A grade below 5 means the placement is repeated, not the\n"
"                            module: the grade is kept, but the final stays pending until the\n"
"                            placement is taken again."
msgstr ""
"Elige el grupo y califica a los estudiantes que han terminado las prácticas "
"de empresa: la nota EM de un estudiante va a todos sus módulos con peso de "
"prácticas — los del curso en marcha y las finales de cursos anteriores aún "
"pendientes. Marca \"Nota por materia\" solo para las excepciones: activa una"
" casilla por módulo, de forma que ese estudiante puede tener una nota "
"distinta en cada uno. Las casillas vacías nunca se escriben. Una nota "
"inferior a 5 significa que se repiten las prácticas, no el módulo: la nota "
"se guarda, pero la final sigue pendiente hasta que se vuelvan a hacer las "
"prácticas."

#. module: ems
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ems.view_order_form_inherit_ems_enrollment
msgid "Re-apply Benefits"
msgstr "Reaplicar beneficios"

#. module: ems
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ems.view_order_form_inherit_ems_enrollment
msgid ""
"This will cancel the current invoice, recompute the enrollment amounts with "
"the student's current benefit status and regenerate the invoice. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Esto cancelará la factura actual, recalculará los importes de la matrícula "
"con el estado de beneficios actual del estudiante y regenerará la factura. "
"¿Continuar?"

#. module: ems
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ems.portal_enrollment_process
msgid ""
"<i class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle me-1\"/>\n"
"                                        <strong>Bonifications and exemptions:</strong>\n"
"                                        if you are entitled to a fee bonification or exemption that is not yet reflected in the amounts above,"
msgstr ""
"<i class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle me-1\"/>\n"
"<strong>Bonificaciones y exenciones:</strong>\n"
"si tienes derecho a una bonificación o exención de tasas que todavía no se "
"ve reflejada en los importes anteriores,"

#. module: ems
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ems.portal_enrollment_process
msgid "upload the supporting document"
msgstr "sube el documento justificativo"

#. module: ems
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ems.portal_enrollment_process
msgid ""
"and wait until it is approved <strong>before confirming your enrollment</strong>.\n"
"                                        Benefits approved after confirmation will not be applied automatically."
msgstr ""
"y espera a que se apruebe <strong>antes de confirmar tu matrícula</strong>. "
"Las bonificaciones o exenciones aprobadas después de la confirmación no se "
"aplicarán."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/enrollment/enrollment.py:0
msgid "Benefits can only be re-applied on a confirmed enrollment."
msgstr "Los beneficios solo se pueden reaplicar en una matrícula confirmada."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/enrollment/enrollment.py:0
msgid ""
"Invoice %s already has payments registered. Issue a credit note manually "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"La factura %s ya tiene pagos registrados. Emite una factura rectificativa "
"manualmente."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/enrollment/enrollment.py:0
msgid ""
"Benefits re-applied by %s: the invoice has been regenerated with the "
"student's current benefit status."
msgstr ""
"Beneficios reaplicados por %s: la factura se ha regenerado con el estado de "
"beneficios actual del estudiante."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_employee__headed_department_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_employee_base__headed_department_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_employee_public__headed_department_ids
msgid "Departments Headed"
msgstr "Departamentos dirigidos"

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ems.field_hr_department__seminar_chief_id
msgid ""
"Every other member of this department (the Department Chief excluded) will "
"have their Manager set to this employee; the Seminar Chief's own Manager is "
"set to the Department Chief."
msgstr ""
"El resto de miembros de este departamento (excluyendo al Jefe de "
"departamento) tendrán como Responsable a este empleado; el Responsable del "
"propio Jefe de seminario será el Jefe de departamento."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_department__seminar_chief_id
msgid "Seminar Chief"
msgstr "Jefe de seminario"

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_employee__seminar_department_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_employee_base__seminar_department_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_employee_public__seminar_department_ids
msgid "Seminars Led"
msgstr "Seminarios dirigidos"

#. module: ems
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ems.view_employee_form
msgid ""
"Set automatically from the employee's department (Department Chief / "
"Seminar Chief). Edit it from the Departments form instead."
msgstr ""
"Se establece automáticamente a partir del departamento del empleado (Jefe "
"de departamento / Jefe de seminario). Edítelo desde el formulario de "
"Departamentos."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/employee.py:0
msgid ""
"The department chief role cannot be assigned or removed manually, it is "
"set automatically from the department's own form."
msgstr ""
"El rol de jefe de departamento no se puede asignar ni quitar manualmente, "
"se gestiona automáticamente desde el formulario del departamento."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/employee.py:0
msgid ""
"The Seminar Chief role cannot be assigned or removed manually, it is set "
"automatically from the department's own form."
msgstr ""
"El rol de jefe de seminario no se puede asignar ni quitar manualmente, se "
"gestiona automáticamente desde el formulario del departamento."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
msgid "A top-level department cannot have a Seminar Chief."
msgstr "Un departamento top-level no puede tener Jefe de seminario."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
msgid "A top-level department cannot have a parent department."
msgstr "Un departamento top-level no puede tener un departamento padre."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ems.field_hr_department__is_top_level
msgid ""
"A top-level department has no parent department and no Seminar Chief. Its "
"Manager is labelled 'Area Manager' and automatically holds the role selected"
" below (Head of Studies, Deputy Head of Studies or Secretary) instead of "
"Department Chief."
msgstr ""
"Un departamento top-level no tiene departamento padre ni Jefe de "
"seminario. Su Responsable se llama 'Responsable de área' y tiene "
"automáticamente el rol seleccionado debajo (Jefe de estudios, Jefe de "
"estudios adjunto o Secretario/a) en lugar de Jefe de departamento."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
msgid "Only a top-level department can have a Role selected."
msgstr "Solo un departamento top-level puede tener un Rol seleccionado."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ems.field_hr_department__top_level_role
msgid ""
"Only applies when this is a Top-level Department: which of the two Head of "
"Studies positions its Manager holds."
msgstr ""
"Solo se aplica cuando se trata de un Departamento top-level: cuál de los "
"dos cargos de Jefe de estudios ocupa su Responsable."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/employee.py:0
msgid ""
"The Deputy Head of Studies role cannot be assigned or removed manually, it "
"is set automatically from the top-level department's own form."
msgstr ""
"El rol de Jefe de estudios adjunto no se puede asignar ni quitar "
"manualmente, se gestiona automáticamente desde el formulario del "
"departamento top-level."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/employee.py:0
msgid ""
"The Head of Studies role cannot be assigned or removed manually, it is set "
"automatically from the top-level department's own form."
msgstr ""
"El rol de Jefe de estudios no se puede asignar ni quitar manualmente, se "
"gestiona automáticamente desde el formulario del departamento top-level."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_department__is_top_level
msgid "Top-level Department"
msgstr "Departamento top-level"

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/employee.py:0
msgid ""
"The Director role cannot be assigned or removed manually, it is set "
"automatically from Settings."
msgstr ""
"El rol de Director no se puede asignar ni quitar manualmente, se gestiona "
"automáticamente desde Ajustes."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ems.field_res_company__director_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ems.field_res_config_settings__director_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ems.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"The person acting as the center's Director. Every top-level department's "
"Manager (Head of Studies/Deputy) will have their own Manager set to this "
"employee automatically."
msgstr ""
"La persona que ejerce de Director/a del centro. El Responsable de "
"cualquier departamento top-level (Jefe de estudios/adjunto) se establecerá "
"automáticamente a este empleado."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/employee.py:0
msgid ""
"The Secretary role cannot be assigned or removed manually, it is set "
"automatically from the top-level department's own form."
msgstr ""
"El rol de Secretario/a no se puede asignar ni quitar manualmente, se "
"gestiona automáticamente desde el formulario del departamento top-level."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_department__top_level_area
msgid "Area"
msgstr "Área"

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ems.field_hr_department__top_level_area
msgid ""
"Only applies when this is a Top-level Department: which staff population "
"this area covers - determines which Role is valid below (Academic -> Head of"
" Studies/Deputy; ASP -> Secretary)."
msgstr ""
"Solo aplica cuando se trata de un Departamento top-level: qué población de "
"personal cubre esta área - determina qué Rol es válido debajo (Académica -> "
"Jefe de estudios/adjunto; ASP -> Secretario/a)."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.module.category,name:ems.category_roles
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:ems.selection__hr_department__top_level_area__academic
msgid "Academic"
msgstr "Académica"

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ems.field_hr_department__shares_manager_with_parent
msgid "Shares Manager with Parent"
msgstr "Comparte Responsable con el padre"

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ems.field_hr_department__shares_manager_with_parent
msgid ""
"If set, this department has no Manager of its own - every member (and, if "
"this department itself has children, their own Chief's Manager too) uses the"
" nearest ancestor department's Manager instead, walking up the hierarchy "
"until one is found."
msgstr ""
"Si está marcado, este departamento no tiene Responsable propio - todos los "
"miembros (y, si este departamento tiene hijos, el Responsable de su propio "
"Jefe también) utilizan en su lugar el Responsable del antepasado más "
"cercano, subiendo por la jerarquía hasta encontrar uno."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
msgid ""
"A top-level department cannot share its Manager with a parent department."
msgstr ""
"Un departamento top-level no puede compartir su Responsable con un "
"departamento padre."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
msgid ""
"Head of Studies / Deputy Head of Studies can only be selected for an "
"Academic top-level department."
msgstr ""
"Jefe de estudios / Jefe de estudios adjunto solo se puede seleccionar para "
"un departamento top-level Académico."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
msgid "Secretary can only be selected for an ASP top-level department."
msgstr ""
"Secretario/a solo se puede seleccionar para un departamento top-level de "
"ASP."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
msgid "Only a top-level department can have an Area selected."
msgstr "Solo un departamento top-level puede tener un Área seleccionada."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
msgid ""
"A department can only share its Manager with a parent department if it has "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Un departamento solo puede compartir su Responsable con un departamento "
"padre si tiene uno."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
msgid ""
"A department cannot have its own Manager and also share its Manager with its"
" parent department."
msgstr ""
"Un departamento no puede tener Responsable propio y a la vez compartir su "
"Responsable con su departamento padre."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/attendance/attendance_template.py:0
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/department.py:0
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/role.py:0
msgid "Color must be a hexadecimal code (e.g. #3A8DDE)."
msgstr "El color debe ser un código hexadecimal (p. ej. #3A8DDE)."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ems.field_ems_attendance_template__color
msgid "Free-pick display color, used to tell templates apart in the list view."
msgstr "Color de visualización libre, para distinguir las plantillas en la vista de lista."

#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ems.field_hr_department__custom_color
msgid "Free-pick display color for this department (not Odoo's native, fixed-palette 'Color' field, which the kanban view still uses internally)."
msgstr "Color de visualización libre para este departamento (no el campo 'Color' nativo de Odoo, de paleta fija, que la vista kanban sigue utilizando internamente)."

#. module: ems
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ems/models/employees/role.py:0
msgid "This role is already assigned to another one."
msgstr "Este rol ya está asignado a otra persona."
